{"id":"05a599f85e508061","group":"89","path":"89/meta/glossary.md","title":"glossary","display":"glossary","type":"note","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"89-Glossary-—-标准记号术语表\">89 Glossary — 标准记号术语表</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>版本</strong>: 1.2\n<strong>书籍</strong>: The Logic of Provability\n<strong>编号</strong>: 89\n<strong>创建日期</strong>: 2026-05-06\n<strong>修订日期</strong>: 2026-09-09\n<strong>创建依据</strong>: 从 df- 文件中提取核心符号定义</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心符号定义\">核心符号定义</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号名称</th>\n<th>标准记号</th>\n<th>定义来源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Gödel-Löb逻辑</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></td>\n<td>包含 Löb 公理模式的最小正常模态逻辑；公理 4 可导出而非原始加入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态逻辑K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{K}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></td>\n<td>基本模态逻辑，包含公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(A \\to B) \\to (\\Box A \\to \\Box B)\">\\(\\Box(A \\to B) \\to (\\Box A \\to \\Box B)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必然算子</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5612f6febc1886d8\" href=\"?note=5612f6febc1886d8\" title=\"89-df-modal-operator\">89-df-modal-operator</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\varphi\">\\(\\Box\\varphi\\)</span> 表示&quot;必然 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;或&quot;在所有可及世界中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 真&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可能算子</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5612f6febc1886d8\" href=\"?note=5612f6febc1886d8\" title=\"89-df-modal-operator\">89-df-modal-operator</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\\varphi \\coloneqq \\neg\\Box\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond\\varphi \\coloneqq \\neg\\Box\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，表示&quot;可能 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kripke框架</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\\)</span>，由可能世界集和可达关系组成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kripke模型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span>，包含框架和赋值函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可能世界</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></td>\n<td>可能世界集，元素记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w, v\">\\(w, v\\)</span> 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可及关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq W \\times W\">\\(R \\subseteq W \\times W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span> 表示从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赋值函数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V: \\mathrm{Prop} \\to \\mathcal{P}(W)\">\\(V: \\mathrm{Prop} \\to \\mathcal{P}(W)\\)</span>，将命题变元映射到为真的世界集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Peano算术</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></td>\n<td>算术解释的目标一阶理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限性谓词</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></td>\n<td>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 及双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\to X\">\\(n\\to X\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态公式集</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></td>\n<td>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、命题变元、否定、合取和必然算子自由生成的公式集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可证性谓词</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x) = \\exists y\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x) = \\exists y\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明谓词</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中的证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算术解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></td>\n<td>由实现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 结构递归扩张，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 译为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态命题重言式</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></td>\n<td>把每个盒公式视为命题原子后恒真的模态公式集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Löb公理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box A \\to A) \\to \\Box A\">\\(\\Box(\\Box A \\to A) \\to \\Box A\\)</span> 的全部模式实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公理4</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{4}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"883bfda9f28cc5ea\" href=\"?note=883bfda9f28cc5ea\" title=\"89-df-4-axiom\">89-df-4-axiom</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A \\to \\Box\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A \\to \\Box\\Box A\\)</span> 的全部模式实例；在 GL 中由 Löb 模式导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K公理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(A \\to B) \\to (\\Box A \\to \\Box B)\">\\(\\Box(A \\to B) \\to (\\Box A \\to \\Box B)\\)</span> 的全部模式实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必然化规则</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nec}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"c0935403945ab4ea\" href=\"?note=c0935403945ab4ea\" title=\"89-df-necessitation\">89-df-necessitation</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,\\Box A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Nec}\">\\(\\langle A,\\Box A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Nec}\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in L\">\\(A\\in L\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in L\">\\(\\Box A\\in L\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分离规则</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></td>\n<td>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GL框架</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL\\text{-}Frame}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{GL\\text{-}Frame}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></td>\n<td>满足传递性和逆良基性的框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆良基</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}(R)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的逆关系是良基的，无无限上升链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在世界中真</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"920317161a2cce71\" href=\"?note=920317161a2cce71\" title=\"89-df-truth-at-world\">89-df-truth-at-world</a></td>\n<td>公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> 的世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 中为真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满足关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></td>\n<td>递归定义的局部真值关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models A\">\\(M,w\\models A\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反射原则</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}(T)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"396f9d3c403d0603\" href=\"?note=396f9d3c403d0603\" title=\"89-df-reflection-principle\">89-df-reflection-principle</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\}\\)</span>；这是局部反射模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型模型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_L\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_L\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_L = (W_L, R_L, V_L)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_L = (W_L, R_L, V_L)\\)</span>，用于完全性证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型世界</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_L\">\\(W_L\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></td>\n<td>包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>、一致、对分离封闭且完备的公式集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可证性逻辑</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(T)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"19a5fceb5d504d9f\" href=\"?note=19a5fceb5d504d9f\" title=\"89-df-provability-logic\">89-df-provability-logic</a></td>\n<td>在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-算术实现下都落入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> 的模态公式集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不动点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{L}(A,p,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{L}(A,p,B)\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-30\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B])\\in L\">\\((B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B])\\in L\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Solovay定理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-31\" data-note=\"1cc7f2e21119da30\" href=\"?note=1cc7f2e21119da30\" title=\"89-df-solovay-theorem\">89-df-solovay-theorem</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 当且仅当每个 PA 算术实现都把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 送到 PA 定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Löb定理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}) \\to \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}) \\to \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-32\" data-note=\"6cbce44a943995a0\" href=\"?note=6cbce44a943995a0\" title=\"89-df-lob-theorem\">89-df-lob-theorem</a></td>\n<td>可证性逻辑的核心定理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"模态公理与框架性质对照表\">模态公理与框架性质对照表</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架性质</th>\n<th>关系条件</th>\n<th>对应公理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>自反性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRw\">\\(wRw\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\to p\">\\(\\Box p \\to p\\)</span> (T)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\land vRu \\to wRu\">\\(wRv \\land vRu \\to wRu\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\to \\Box\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p \\to \\Box\\Box p\\)</span> (4)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\to vRw\">\\(wRv \\to vRw\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\to \\Box\\Diamond p\">\\(p \\to \\Box\\Diamond p\\)</span> (B)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv \\land wRu \\to vRu\">\\(wRv \\land wRu \\to vRu\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond p \\to \\Box\\Diamond p\">\\(\\Diamond p \\to \\Box\\Diamond p\\)</span> (5)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆良基</td>\n<td>无无限上升链</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p \\to p) \\to \\Box p\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p \\to p) \\to \\Box p\\)</span> (Löb)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"GL逻辑的定义\">GL逻辑的定义</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{K}+\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{K}+\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公理 4 在 GL 中由 Löb 公理模式导出，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，但 4 不作为 GL 的原始公理重复加入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"算术解释规则（将模态公式翻译为算术公式）\">算术解释规则（将模态公式翻译为算术公式）</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模态公式</th>\n<th>算术解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (命题变元)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}(p)=r(p)\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}(p)=r(p)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\tau_{T,r}(A)\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\">\\(A\\land B\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}(A\\land B)=\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\land\\tau_{T,r}(B)\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}(A\\land B)=\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\land\\tau_{T,r}(B)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(A)\\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"禁止使用的记号（历史遗留/非标准）\">禁止使用的记号（历史遗留/非标准）</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误记号</th>\n<th>正确记号</th>\n<th>问题说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square\">\\(\\square\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span></td>\n<td>使用Unicode方框符号而非LaTeX宏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span> (全角)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span></td>\n<td>使用标准Diamond符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(w,v)\">\\(R(w,v)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span></td>\n<td>应使用中缀关系记号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\vDash \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\vDash \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>缺少世界参数，应用局部真值关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}(x)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span></td>\n<td>未指明理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W = \\{w_i\\}\">\\(W = \\{w_i\\}\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W = \\{w_1, w_2, \\ldots\\}\">\\(W = \\{w_1, w_2, \\ldots\\}\\)</span></td>\n<td>使用省略号不如显式枚举清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash A\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash A\\)</span>（当 GL 已定义为公式集时）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span></td>\n<td>避免把对象公式集合与未另行类型化的元语言可证关系混用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"参考文献\">参考文献</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Cambridge University Press.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"89-Glossary-—-标准记号术语表","text":"89 Glossary — 标准记号术语表","level":1},{"id":"核心符号定义","text":"核心符号定义","level":2},{"id":"模态公理与框架性质对照表","text":"模态公理与框架性质对照表","level":2},{"id":"GL逻辑的定义","text":"GL逻辑的定义","level":2},{"id":"算术解释规则（将模态公式翻译为算术公式）","text":"算术解释规则（将模态公式翻译为算术公式）","level":2},{"id":"禁止使用的记号（历史遗留/非标准）","text":"禁止使用的记号（历史遗留/非标准）","level":2},{"id":"参考文献","text":"参考文献","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"核心符号定义","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"核心符号定义","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5612f6febc1886d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"核心符号定义","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5612f6febc1886d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"核心符号定义","exce